---
// Advantages.astro - 4 Core Pillars & Features
---
<section class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-slate-900 text-white relative overflow-hidden" id="advantages">
  <!-- Ambient background glow accents -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-sky-500/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 sm:mb-20">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-cyan-300 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mb-3 border border-white/15" data-i18n="why_eyebrow">
        Предности
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-5xl tracking-tight text-white" data-i18n="why_title">
        Зошто да изнајмите од Ски Надја?
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Feature Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      
      <!-- Feature 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-400/40 p-8 rounded-3xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            🎿
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-white mb-3" data-i18n="feat1_t">Директно на Патеката</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed" data-i18n="feat1_d">
            Нема потреба да носите тешка опрема со автомобил или низ паркинзи. Земете ги скиите и веднаш стапнете на патеката.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-400/40 p-8 rounded-3xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            ⚙️
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-white mb-3" data-i18n="feat2_t">Прецизно Сервисирање</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed" data-i18n="feat2_d">
            Везовите се нагодуваат строго според вашата тежина, висина и вештина според ISO DIN безбедносни стандарди.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-400/40 p-8 rounded-3xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            ♨️
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-white mb-3" data-i18n="feat3_t">Греени Професионални Сушари</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed" data-i18n="feat3_d">
            Обувките поминуваат низ озонска дезинфекција и сушење на топол воздух. Облекувате сува и пријатна чизма секој пат.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4 -->
      <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-400/40 p-8 rounded-3xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            🏡
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-white mb-3" data-i18n="feat4_t">Комплетен Зимски Пакет</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed" data-i18n="feat4_d">
            Покрај ски и сноуборд опрема, нудиме и сместување во прекрасна планинска вила на Пониква за целосен зимски одмор.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
